  "answer_text": "- Upstream TLS inspection: The Socket upgrade process requires connectivity to the Cato Cloud, and HTTPS traffic from the Socket's WAN IP address must be excluded from upstream TLS inspection. \n- Gradual upgrade ports on an X1700: Port 1 is WAN1 (to Cato). If you have a second WAN (WAN2) enabled, it uses Port 2 (or Port 3, depending on the LAN/WAN configuration). Ensure the appropriate WAN ports (and their mappings) are connected to the internet/ISP during a gradual upgrade.",
